{"title": "[情報] 今日Luka Doncic", "author": "SeanLi1013 (TrunksHOPE)", "board": "", "date": "Sat Nov  7 14:05:09 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1794031513.A.D7F.html", "body": "https://www.nba.com/game/por-vs-lal-0022600032/box-score\n\n今日Luka Doncic\n\n53分5籃板5助攻\nFG：17-33\n\nhttps://x.com/novig/status/2118935714469716269?a=NEHYNaSqBv3LSow53RI&s=46\n\nLUKA DONCIC JUST PASSED MICHAEL JORDAN\n\nMost points through the first 9 games of a season since the NBA-ABA merger:\n\nLuka Doncic (2026–27): 348\nMichael Jordan (1986–87): 347\n\nLuka is making NBA HISTORY.\n\nNBA與ABA合併以來，球員在每個球季前9場比賽的總得分紀錄：\n\nLuka Doncic（2026–27 球季）：348分\nMichael Jordan（1986–87 球季）：347分\n\nLuka Doncic以348分超越Michael Jordan，創下新的NBA歷史紀錄！\n\nhttps://x.com/thebenroyer/status/2118936148018081857?a=gQw5QJ_bFiyOGMmYuU8&s=4\n\n6\n\nWith his 40th point of the night vs. Portland, Luka Doncic recorded his 24th 4\n0-point game as a Laker, passing George Mikan for fifth most in franchise regu\nlar-season history.\n\n4. Shaquille O’Neal (26)\n\n5. Luka Doncic (24)\n\n6. George Mikan (23)\n\nLuka Doncic在今晚對戰拓荒者的比賽中，攻下個人第40分，這也是他身披湖人球衣第24\n次單場得分突破40分。\n\n超越George Mikan，升上湖人隊史例行賽單場40分場次排行榜第五名。\n\n湖人隊史例行賽單場至少40分場次排行榜：\n\n4. Shaquille O’Neal：26次\n\n5. Luka Doncic：24次\n\n6. George Mikan：23次\n\nhttps://x.com/brettsiegelnba/status/2118935571162964320?a=NJxyZTSUG-HZ5thl1Cw&\n\ns=46\n\nLuka Doncic has registered his fourth consecutive 40-point game, joining legen\nds like Elgin Baylor, Kobe Bryant and George Mikan as the only Lakers to accom\nplish this feat during the regular season.\n\nLuka Doncic連續第四場比賽攻下至少40分，成為湖人隊史例行賽中，第四位達成連續四\n場40分紀錄的球員。\n\n他與Elgin Baylor、Kobe Bryant及 George Mikan等傳奇球星並列，成為湖人隊史上僅有\n的四位達成這項成就的球員！\n\nhttps://x.com/lawmurraythenu/status/2118945936420577365?a=xHFnSh-yU_KmPPbRtQE&\n\ns=46\n\nLuka Doncic passed Kareem Abdul-Jabbar and tied Allen Iverson for 10th on all-\ntime list of 50-point games. Tonight is his 11th.\n\nLuka Doncic超越了Kareem Abdul-Jabbar，並追平Allen Iverson，並列NBA歷史50分場次\n排行榜第十位。\n\n今晚這場比賽，是他生涯第11次單場攻下50分！\n\n———\n心得：77 MVP！", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "luck945", "content": "又50分啦!!!", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "lafeelbarth", "content": "大解放", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "jeff1013", "content": "穩了", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "mrfootball", "content": "MVP MVP MVP", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "dakkk", "content": "今天沒話說", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "YeSerD", "content": "MVP", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "aa01081008tw", "content": "這季是拿首座MVP的時候了吧", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hcl00", "content": "今日MVP", "time": "11/07 14:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "garfeyXX", "content": "超猛77", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Kai877", "content": "某人走了直接解放了", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "hua0122", "content": "天天爆發 救湖人", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "ayubabbit", "content": "狗特", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Jinx", "content": "\\MVP/\\MVP/\\MVP/", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "heaventrain", "content": "MVP", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "chocobo4235", "content": "目前為止完全沒有一隊守得住77", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Royalweger", "content": "還有下半季的考驗，先不要", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "breadsuper6", "content": "今年不受傷保持65場，真的可以跟斑馬競爭MVP", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "ooxxman", "content": "帶隊逆轉，全隊沒三分時就他隨便投", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "kiolp", "content": "這開季 場均快40了 跟鬼一樣", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "spen2005", "content": "弱隊重拳出擊", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "jumbojumbo", "content": "MVP!", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "dakkk", "content": "有吧 守最好的就是勇士", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "karta1992560", "content": "MVP MVP77", "time": "11/07 14:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "loverxa", "content": "但哪天沒上場 就等於湖人少了4.50分的輸出", "t